WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:06.025
Video 10. Bija state maathi purchase, ane
tamara bills.

00:00:06.225 --> 00:00:11.414
Gujarat ni andar, tax CGST + SGST chhe.

00:00:11.344 --> 00:00:17.014
Bija state maathi, tax IGST chhe: poora dar nu
ek ledger.

00:00:17.313 --> 00:00:20.115
V, pachhi F9: Purchase.

00:00:20.815 --> 00:00:27.340
Supplier no invoice number lakho, MF/118, ane
eni taarikh.

00:00:27.370 --> 00:00:31.601
Party: Mehta Fabrics. Pachhi Purchase Account.

00:00:32.301 --> 00:00:38.752
Cotton Fabric, Ring Road Warehouse ma: 300
metres, ₹115 na bhaave.

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:50.420
Item ni niche click karo, ane IGST pasand
karo. Hisaab ₹1,725 gane chhe.

00:00:50.450 --> 00:00:56.683
Narration lakho. Hisaab puchhe chhe: Accept?
Yes maate Y.

00:00:57.763 --> 00:01:05.536
Bill-wise details khule chhe. Bill New Ref
chhe: MF/118.

00:01:05.566 --> 00:01:10.242
Mehta Fabrics na credit period parthi 45 divas
aave chhe.

00:01:10.272 --> 00:01:15.933
Divaso ni jagyae tame taarikh lakhi shako: 16
May 2026.

00:01:15.963 --> 00:01:19.364
Ctrl+A thi purchase save thay chhe.

00:01:20.444 --> 00:01:23.191
Esc dabavo to Gateway par jao.

00:01:23.221 --> 00:01:28.980
Alt+G, "bills pay" lakho, ane Enter dabavo:
Bills Payable.

00:01:29.041 --> 00:01:37.277
Mehta Fabrics nu bill MF/118: ₹36,225, 16 May
e due.

00:01:37.307 --> 00:01:45.727
Bills Receivable biji baaju batave chhe: Sharma
Traders nu bill 1, ₹53,025, 1 May e due.

00:01:46.207 --> 00:01:51.978
Tamara grahak paasethi tamne ₹53,025 malvana
chhe.

00:01:51.908 --> 00:01:57.169
Tamare supplier ne ₹36,225 aapvana chhe.

00:01:57.369 --> 00:02:03.972
Darek bill ni due date hoy chhe. Have pachhi:
payment, receipt ane contra.

